  "description": "He was his cradle, his savior, and his first love—until his memories were wiped clean. Trusted with raising five-year-old Esper prodigy Tae-Hyun, S-Rank Guide Shin-Hae gave the boy everything: safety, guidance, and unconditional warmth. Naturally, Tae-Hyun grew up holding Shin-Hae at the center of his universe. But a ruthless abduction plot tears them apart, robbing Tae-Hyun of all memories of the man who raised him. Years later, when fate draws the powerful Esper back to his former guardian, an instinctual, overwhelming pull ignites once more. Can love bridge the gap of lost time?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
